# NyxVault

NyxVault is a lightweight, cross-platform file protection utility designed for developers and privacy-conscious users. It allows users to securely encrypt, organize, and manage sensitive files directly from the command line.

## Features

* AES-256 file encryption and decryption
* Password-protected vaults
* Secure file deletion
* Directory synchronization
* Automatic backup creation
* Cross-platform support (Windows, Linux, macOS)
* Simple and intuitive CLI interface

## Installation

```bash
nyxvault create myvault
nyxvault add secret.pdf
nyxvault lock
nyxvault unlock
```

## Vision
```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/NyxVault.git
cd NyxVault
pip install -r requirements.txt
```
## Technologies

* Python 3.12
* Cryptography Library
* SQLite for metadata management
* Typer for CLI commands 

## Usage


NyxVault aims to provide an elegant and developer-friendly approach to personal file security without relying on cloud services or complex graphical interfaces.
